 "terms": [
  "1. Scope of Work \u2014 Only the work described under Scope of Work is included. Additional work, changes, or extras require written approval before proceeding and are invoiced separately.",
  "2. Utility Locates \u2014 Underground utility locations and sizes are unknown at the time of quotation. Locates are requested on award; soft digs (hydrovac) and safety watches required by utility owners are extra per the Additional Costs schedule and confirmed by change order before mobilizing.",
  "3. Ground Conditions \u2014 Abnormal ground conditions (rock, high water table, unstable or contaminated soils, unmarked obstructions) are extra at $400/hr plus materials and sub-trades.",
  "4. Delays \u2014 Crew time lost to delays beyond our control (utility requirements, site access, weather, other trades) is billed at our hourly crew rate.",
  "5. Frost Surcharge \u2014 A 25% surcharge applies to any work completed between December 1 and March 31.",
  "6. Restoration \u2014 No restoration of any kind on private property is included (grass, sod, fencing, concrete, paving stones, landscaping).",
  "7. Incidental Damage \u2014 Incidental damage to City property (sidewalks, roadways, curbs, boulevards) is an additional cost; the City inspector has final say.",
  "8. Permits & Deposits \u2014 The client is responsible for all deposits required by the City of Winnipeg, including street-cut deposits. Cut permit charges are set by the City inspector after construction and invoiced accordingly.",
  "9. Payment \u2014 25% (pre-tax) deposit is required before mobilization. The balance is due upon completion. Late payment is subject to additional fees and charges.",
  "10. Validity \u2014 This quotation is valid for 10 days, and work must commence within 30 days of acceptance.",
  "11. Workmanship Warranty \u2014 Workmanship is warranted for one year from the completion date.",
  "12. Materials \u2014 All materials remain the property of Rondor Excavations Ltd. until paid in full.",
  "13. Insurance \u2014 Rondor Excavations Ltd. carries commercial general liability insurance and WCB coverage."
 ],
